			<item>
				<title>Dad in the combine</title>
				<link>/dad-in-combine/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2015 04:05:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>/dad-in-combine/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Keith got done picking corn on the farm today. He says, &amp;ldquo;It was really good (244bu/ac) and really dry (15% moisture).  I&amp;rsquo;m glad we got it out when we did because it was starting to fall in today&amp;rsquo;s wind.  Your dad came out and rode along with dad. I think he really enjoyed it.  I took some pictures today including one of your dad in the combine. I was really sneaky so I don&amp;rsquo;t think he knows I I took it. &amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
